  "text": "Animal Hospital in South Deerfield, MA | Veterinary Emergency & Specialty Hospitals (VESH)\nSkip to Primary Content\nFind a Location\nContact Us\nCareers\nER Check-In\n(413) 665-4911\nAbout Us\nOur Story\nSouth Deerfield Team\nWest Springfield Team\nServices\n24/7 Emergency\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nAll Services\nPet Owners\nCheck-In\nPrescription Refills\nFor Veterinarians\nReferral Information\nReferral Portal\nClinical Trials\nFind a Location\nEmergency\nWelcome to VESH South Deerfield\nYour 24-Hour Emergency and Specialty Animal Hospital in South Deerfield, MA\nServices\nVESH South Deerfield is a veterinary specialty and emergency hospital equipped with the most advanced diagnostic and medical equipment to support pets requiring emergency treatment, advanced procedures, specialist treatment, or surgery in South Deerfield, Northampton, Greenfield, and the surrounding areas.\nView Our Services Page >\nEmergency & Critical Care\nCardiology\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nSurgery\nAbout VESH South Deerfield\nVeterinary Emergency & Specialty Hospital is just a few minutes off I-91 in South Deerfield, Massachusetts. We chose that location because of its central proximity to western MA, southern Vermont, New Hampshire, northern Connecticut, and upstate New York.\nSituated on 14 acres of partially wooded land, our facility has plenty of parking spaces, so you never need to worry about city traffic or parking when your pet is having a medical emergency.\nMeet Our Team\nSouth Deerfield Team\nOur Facility Features\nClean, efficient examination rooms\nPreparation area for treating pets\nFully equipped ICU with:\nOxygen cage\nMonitoring equipment\nFluid pumps\nSurgery suites with advanced equipment, including:\nVentilators\nAnesthesia machine\nPatient monitoring equipment\nIsolation units for pets with contagious diseases\nUltrasound\nAdvanced CT scan imaging\nDigital radiography\nEndoscopy equipment\nLaparoscopic instrumentation\nComplete in-house laboratory\nWireless telemetry system\nBlood bank\nWe are proud that our state-of-the-art facility, 24/7 emergency capabilities, high-level staffing, and medical records management at our facility. These capabilities have qualified VESH to attain Level II certification from the Veterinary Emergency & Critical Care Society (VECCS), an esteemed third-party standards agency.\nWhat’s more, VESH can provide continuous patient care and treatment utilizing a large backup generator in the event of a power loss.\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(413) 665-4911\nFax:\n(413) 665-4934\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nAbout Us\nOur South Deerfield Team\nOur West Springfield Team\nCareers\nAll Services\nEmergency\n©\nCopyright\n2026\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nContact Us\nCookie Preferences\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
